luckychaos.guide.body=1. Get blocks from Creative/Items or /give @s luckychaos:lucky_block (also super_lucky_block and chaos_lucky_block).\n2. Place and break a block for one outcome.\n3. Gold = balanced, cyan = better rewards, magenta = riskier chaos.\n4. Use this Compass for XP, skills, and discoveries.\n5. Operators choose Survival/Arena and Co-op/Versus in Settings. Arena setup is optional and never resets.\n6. Terrain destruction and pranks can be disabled. Back up important worlds!
